				  <p><a href="javascript: setActiveDiv(1);">Working at ROBLOX</a></p>
				  <p>&nbsp;</p>
				  <h2>Hey You. Over here. Arrrr!</h2>
				  <img class="imageright" src="images/pirate.png" alt="" border="0"/>
				  <p>ROBLOX is a great product, with a lot of traction in the marketplace. However, it is a work in progress.</p>
				  <p>I need you to implement roiling seas for me to captain my ship on, refractive gem shaders to add that characteristic glint to my treasure hoard, and, if it's not too much to ask, sea monsters, just for the romance of it all.</p>
				  <p>Some of my deckhands are mac users, so we&rsquo;ll need to take care of them too.</p>
				  <p>There's also a host of social web features I need in order to be able to effectively coordinate raids on the colonials across my pirate hoard, which is 12,000 users strong. And we need *someone* to get around to making all this happen in a realtime, scalable environment. Pirates hate waiting for page loads.</p>

				  <p>Don't disappoint this old sea dog, send in your resume today!</p>
			  </div>
